{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, עֲבִידָה","hw":"עֲבִידָה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">עֲבִידָה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. work, service (</strong>BH <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲבֹדָה</span><strong>)</strong>;—emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲבִידְתָּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:8\" href=\"/Ezra.5.8\">Ezr 5:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:49\" href=\"/Daniel.2.49\">Dn 2:49</a>, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲבִידַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:24\" href=\"/Ezra.4.24\">Ezr 4:24</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>work</em>, of building temple, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:24\" href=\"/Ezra.4.24\">Ezr 4:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:8\" href=\"/Ezra.5.8\">5:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:7\" href=\"/Ezra.6.7\">6:7</a>; = <em>administration</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:49\" href=\"/Daniel.2.49\">Dn 2:49</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:12\" href=\"/Daniel.3.12\">3:12</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>ritual, service</em>, of God <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:18\" href=\"/Ezra.6.18\">Ezr 6:18</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, מַעֲבַד²","prev":"BDB Aramaic, עֲבֵד נְגוֹ"}